### ACCOUNT : créer un compte
POST http://localhost:8081/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerReference":"CUST-001","currency":"EUR","balance":500}

### ACCOUNT : lister
GET http://localhost:8081/api/accounts

### ACCOUNT : via la gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts

### TRANSACTION : créer (remplace UUID-DU-COMPTE par l'id du compte créé)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"UUID-DU-COMPTE","amount":100,"currency":"EUR","merchantCategory":"FOOD","country":"MA"}

### TRANSACTION : plafond dépassé (doit renvoyer 400)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"UUID-DU-COMPTE","amount":1500,"currency":"EUR","merchantCategory":"FOOD","country":"MA"}

### TRANSACTION : lister
GET http://localhost:8082/api/transactions

### TRANSACTION : via la gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactionsservices:
    kafka:
    image: apache/kafka:3.8.0
    container_name: kafka
    ports:
    - "9092:9092"